+## Reference Hydration P0
+
+Watch identity tracking is fail-closed. Movie/cinema assets must create a
+cast/character reference-candidate package before ingest/tracking. Drone,
+ITAR, RTSP, and YouTube streams must use source-provided reference manifests
+or fail closed. Detector labels and public movie-domain source candidates are
+observation/reference priors only; they do not prove scene visibility or named
+identity. Supported identity requires approved references, bounded track
+observations, comparison evidence, persistence receipts, and later `$memory
+recall` proof.
+
