+### Watch Reference Hydration P0
+
+- Cinema/movie assets default to automatic reference-candidate hydration.
+- Drone/ITAR/RTSP/YouTube assets require source-provided manifests or fail closed.
+- Public search and detector labels cannot promote identity.
+- Arango stores structured metadata and Qdrant pointers, never raw vectors.
+- Memory recall is the official retrieval path; direct Qdrant/Arango answers are not valid Watch user answers.
+
