+## P0 preflight: reference hydration
+
+Before real-time tracking starts, Watch must build a
+`watch.reference_hydration_plan.v1`. Movie assets may collect public movie-domain
+reference candidates, but those candidates only feed approval and embedding
+steps. Non-movie stream assets must provide source manifests and fail closed when
+they are absent. The tracker may stream low-rate observations while identity is
+pending, but `IDENTITY_SUPPORTED` requires approved references plus evidence and
+later `$memory recall` proof.
